### Greenhouse API - REST Client examples
### Use the VS Code "REST Client" extension and click "Send Request".
### The browser uses an HttpOnly cookie; for curl/REST Client copy the
### access_token into @token below (Bearer remains supported).

@host = http://localhost:8000
@token = PASTE_TOKEN_HERE
@device_token = PASTE_DEVICE_TOKEN_HERE

### Health
GET {{host}}/health

### Login (admin; also sets the HttpOnly session cookie)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "TU_ADMIN_PASSWORD"
}

### Logout (clears the session cookie)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/logout

### Current user
GET {{host}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### System status
GET {{host}}/api/config/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Active config
GET {{host}}/api/config/active
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Latest telemetry
GET {{host}}/api/config/telemetry/latest
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Telemetry history (last 24 h)
GET {{host}}/api/config/telemetry/history?hours=24&limit=500
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Crop catalogue
GET {{host}}/api/crops/all
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Apply a new configuration (admin)
POST {{host}}/api/config/apply
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "crop_id": 1,
  "config_json": {
    "crop": "tomate",
    "hysteresis": {
      "temp": { "on_above": 30.0, "off_below": 27.5 },
      "humidity": { "on_below": 60.0, "off_above": 68.0 },
      "soil": { "on_below_pct": 35, "off_above_pct": 45 }
    },
    "irrigation": { "enabled": false },
    "safety": { "max_on_seconds": { "fan": 7200, "humidifier": 7200, "pump": 900 }, "min_off_seconds": { "fan": 0, "humidifier": 0, "pump": 300 } }
  }
}

### Latest photo metadata
GET {{host}}/api/photos/latest
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Unacknowledged events
GET {{host}}/api/events/unacknowledged
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Weather: current + rain forecast (needs OPENWEATHER_API_KEY in .env)
GET {{host}}/api/weather/overview?hours=48
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Notifications: server config + VAPID public key
GET {{host}}/api/notifications/config
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Notifications: register a browser push subscription
POST {{host}}/api/notifications/subscribe
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "endpoint": "https://fcm.googleapis.com/fcm/send/REPLACE_ME",
  "keys": {
    "p256dh": "REPLACE_WITH_BASE64URL_KEY",
    "auth": "REPLACE_WITH_BASE64URL_SECRET"
  },
  "user_agent": "Pixel 8 / Chrome"
}

### Notifications: send a test push to the current user
POST {{host}}/api/notifications/test
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Notifications: remove a subscription
DELETE {{host}}/api/notifications/subscribe
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "endpoint": "https://fcm.googleapis.com/fcm/send/REPLACE_ME"
}

### Public: telemetry without auth
GET {{host}}/api/public/telemetry

### Public: history, photos, weather, crops
GET {{host}}/api/public/telemetry/history?hours=24
GET {{host}}/api/public/photos?limit=30
GET {{host}}/api/public/weather?hours=48
GET {{host}}/api/public/crops

### Admin: control an actuator
POST {{host}}/api/admin/actuators/control
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "actuator": "fan_1",
  "state": true
}

### Admin: apply configuration
POST {{host}}/api/admin/config
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "config_json": {
    "hysteresis": {
      "temp": {"on_above": 30, "off_below": 27.5},
      "humidity": {"on_below": 60, "off_above": 68},
      "soil": {"on_below_pct": 35, "off_above_pct": 45}
    },
    "irrigation": {"enabled": false},
    "safety": {"max_on_seconds": {"pump": 900}}
  },
  "crop_id": null
}

### Admin: audit log
GET {{host}}/api/admin/logs?action=actuator.control&limit=50
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Admin: detailed health
GET {{host}}/api/admin/health
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Admin: create a user
POST {{host}}/api/admin/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "operador",
  "email": "operador@local",
  "password": "OperadorSeguro123!",
  "role": "viewer"
}

### Device-facing telemetry ingest (as the gateway would send it)
POST {{host}}/api/config/telemetry
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "timestamp": "2026-09-21T15:30:00Z",
  "temperature": 26.5,
  "humidity": 72.0,
  "pressure": 1013.2,
  "soil_adc": [2252, 2374, 2129, 2457, 2293, 2539],
  "soil_pct": [45.0, 42.0, 48.0, 40.0, 44.0, 38.0],
  "soil_ok": [true, true, true, true, true, true],
  "fan_1_state": true,
  "fan_2_state": true,
  "humidifier_1_state": false,
  "humidifier_2_state": false,
  "pump_state": false,
  "rssi": -63,
  "device_id": "field_esp32",
  "sequence": 7
}
